"wiki/Challenge%E2%80%93response_authentication>`__ mode or the NitroKey3 for "
"`HOTP <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/HMAC-based_one-time_password>`__ mode,"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/security-in-qubes/mfa.rst:155 0d118dfa18cc435eab2880bc905072db
msgid ""
"store the password for YubiKey / NitroKey3 Login and the Challenge-"
"Response / HOTP secret in dom0,"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/security-in-qubes/mfa.rst:157 52fa9fa6eb2a49679e8279594d75d6e7
